				<element type="warning_sequence">2</element>
                <text type="warning_situation">
				<p>MINOR FLOODING OCCURRING AT TUMMAVILLE </p>

				<p/>
				<p>Thunderstorms have produced heavy rainfall since Friday afternoon in parts of the Upper Condamine River catchment.  River and creek levels are rising and isolated flooding is occurring. Minor flooding is occurring at Tummaville.</p>
<p/>
<p>Further rainfall is forecast over the Upper Condamine catchment in the next few days.</p>

				<p/>

                </text>
                <element type="severity">Minor</element>
            </forecast-period>
